// Title: Potential RDP Session Hijacking Activity
// Rule ID: 224f140f-3553-4cd1-af78-13d81bf9f7cc
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
